---
// Retired event landing page: permanently redirect to the GPU Cost Calculator.
// Astro.redirect emits a static stub with meta refresh + noindex + canonical
// to the target (the previous <meta slot="head" http-equiv="refresh"> was
// silently dropped because Layout has no named "head" slot, so the page
// rendered as a thin, indexable "Redirecting…" page instead).
return Astro.redirect("/gpu-cost-calculator/", 301);
